{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">FULHET EXPLICATIU</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">DE</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">las Taulas Auxiliàrias Delmas</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">PRIMIÈRA SÈRIA</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">TAULA N° 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">L’Escòla. — L’Institut. — La Classa.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Descripcion generala.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Aquesta taula representa una <b>classa</b> d’<b>institut</b>. Dins aquesta classa i a uèch <b>taulas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"taulas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> e uèch <b>bancs</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"bancs\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. Sus cada banc s’assètan tres escolans. Lo <b>professor</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"professor\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> es assetat sus una <b>cadièira</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"cadièira\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> a sa <b>catedra</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"catedra\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — A esquèrra de la catedra i a un <b>armari</b> amb pòrtas de veire <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"fisica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>. A drecha i a lo <b>tablèu negre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"tablèu negre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> amb lo <b>netejador</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"netejador\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> e lo <b>gis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"gis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Dessús la catedra pendolan de <b>laminas muralas</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"laminas muralas\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"laminas muralas\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"laminas muralas\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> e una <b>mapa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — Totes los escolans son pas a sa <b>plaça</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"plaça\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. Joan <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> es drech contra lo tablèu; ten lo netejador e escafa las <b>figuras de geometria</b>.","t01-03-2":"Pèire es a prèp de la catedra; recampa los <b>exercicis escriches</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"exercicis escriches\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> e los pòrta al professor.","t01-04-1":"4. — <b>Aqueste</b> professor es lo professor de <b>lengas modèrnas</b>. Ensenha als escolans de parlar, legir e escriure de lengas estrangièras <b>(alemand, anglés, espanhòl, italian, rus</b> o <b>francés)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — La classa es fòrça vasta e fòrça clara. Al fons i a una <b>fenèstra</b> larga amb dos <b>montants</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"montants\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> e una <b>pòrta veirada</b> per l’aerejar e l’esclairar.","t01-05-2":"Aquesta classa es pas freja. Al mitan, per l’escalfar, i a una <b>estufa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"estufa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> fòrça bona amb son <b>tuble</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tuble\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Sus la paret i a de <b>penjadors</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"penjadors\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button> fixats; ne pendolan las casquetas e los mantèls dels escolans.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">La cort de recreacion.</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — Lo <b>relòtge</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"relòtge\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> marca nòu oras e cinc.","t01-06-2":"La <b>recreacion</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"recreacion\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> ven d’acabar e la classa tòrna començar. La recreacion se fa dins la <b>cort</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"cort\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Vesèm qualques escolans que jògan. Un <b>mèstre d’estudi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"mèstre d'estudi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> los susvelha.","t01-07-1":"7. — Dins la cort vesèm en mai d’autras personas: l’<b>inspector</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspector\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, lo <b>director</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"director\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> e lo <b>cap d’estudis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"cap d'estudis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"L’inspector inspècta las escòlas, lo director dirigís l’institut, lo cap d’estudis susvelha los estudis.","t01-07-3":"Lo quatren personatge es lo <b>concierge</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"concierge\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. Pòrta jos lo braç un registre per i marcar los absents.","t01-08-1":"8. — Al fons de la cort i a los <b>aparelhs de gimnastica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"aparelhs de gimnastica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> e l’obrador de <b>trabalhs manuals</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"trabalhs manuals\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"A drecha de la taula començam de veire las <b>salas</b> de <b>musica</b> e de <b>dessenh</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Descripcion detalhada.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Los bons escolans.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Los escolans del primièr banc a drecha de la catedra son <b>Enric</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"oc-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Estève</b> e <b>Carles</b>.","t01-09-2":"Enric es fòrça atentiu e trabalhador; escota lo professor. Sus sa taula a un <b>quasèrn</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"quasèrn\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, un <b>libre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"libre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, un <b>diccionari</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"diccionari\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> e un <b>plumièr</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"plumièr\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. Son libre a fòrça <b>paginas</b>; cada capítol conten mantun <b>paragraf</b> e cada <b>linha</b> fòrça <b>mots</b>.","t01-09-4":"Son vesin Estève <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> es aplicat. Marca sus son quasèrn la leiçon per lo còp que ven. A una polida <b>escritura</b>. Son libre es barrat. Vesèm pas que la <b>cobèrta</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"cobèrta\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. A son costat i a son <b>compàs</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"compàs\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Carles <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> ten son libre a la man; lo dobrís per repassar la leiçon. Coma totes los escolans, a davant el un <b>tintièr</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"tintièr\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button>. Es obedient.","t01-10-1":"10. — A la taula del costat i a <b>Loís, Antòni</b> e <b>Pau</b>. Loís recita sa <b>leiçon</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"leiçon\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> e respond a las <b>questions</b> del professor. Antòni <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> es fòrça destorbat; de còps lo professor lo castiga quitament. Pau <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> es bon companh, amable e servicial. Es fòrça atentiu.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Los marrits escolans.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Darrièr Enric i a <b>Jòrdi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Jòrdi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. Es pas un marrit dròlle, mas es <b>charraire</b>, destorbat e bolegadís. Sa <b>leugieretat</b> e sa <b>desobeïssença</b> causan de <b>desòrdre</b> pendent la classa, e sovent merita una severa <b>avertida</b>. Son <b>quasèrn de borrolhon</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"quasèrn de borrolhon\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> es brut, l’emplena de <b>tacas de tinta</b> amb sa <b>pluma</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"pluma\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, e per aquò se sèrv totjorn de sa <b>goma d’escafar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"goma d'escafar\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>; sa <b>cartabèla</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"cartabèla\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> es esquiçada, que es fòrça descurós. Perqué pòrta son <b>portalapis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"portalapis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> a la classa de lengas modèrnas?","t01-11-2":"Son vesin Edmond <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> l’aima pas. Es vertat qu’es un pauc pigre, mas es calat e se ten quiet. Charra pas; solament que, al luòc d’escotar, aima mai legir los <b>contes</b> de son <b>libre de lectura</b>.","t01-11-3":"Lo tresen escolan d’aqueste banc es <b>Loís</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Loís\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. Es aplicat. Escriu sus un <b>fuèlh de papièr</b> blanc. Davant el a daissat son <b>papièr secant</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"papièr secant\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — Los escolans del segond banc, a esquèrra del professor, son fòrça joves. Lo primièr, lo pichon <b>Emili</b>, sap pas encara escriure plan; pòrta sa <b>lausa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"lausa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, son <b>lapis de lausa</b> e sa <b>esponga</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"esponga\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>.","t01-12-2":"A son costat i a <b>Auguste</b> e <b>Bernat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. Aqueste darrièr trabalha plan, mas son <b>aspècte</b> es fòrça descurós.","t01-13-1":"13. — Darrièr eles i a tres <b>pigres</b>. <b>Albèrt</b> apren pas sas leiçons. <b>Jaume</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Jaume\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> dormís al luòc d’escotar. Sa <b>peresa</b> li mena de <b>reprensions</b> e quitament de <b>castigs</b>. Enfin, <b>Cristian</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Cristian\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> es tròp leugièr. Se <b>compòrta</b> mal e fa pas cap d’esfòrç per s’amendar.","t01-14-1":"14. — Sos vesins, al contrari, se compòrtan plan. <b>Ernèst</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernèst\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> aima l’òrdre e la regularitat; se sèrv totjorn de sa <b>règla</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"règla\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> e de son <b>lapis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"lapis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. Es <b>extèrne</b>.","t01-14-2":"<b>Francés</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Francés\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> es <b>intèrne</b>; pòrta l’<b>unifòrme</b> de l’institut; i manja e i dormís. Es un bon <b>companh</b>.","t01-14-3":"Maurici agusa son <b>lapis</b> amb son <b>cotelet</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"cotelet\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>; es fòrça curós.","t01-14-4":"Pòrta totes sos libres, sa <b>gramatica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramatica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, son <b>quasèrn de nòtas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"quasèrn de nòtas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button> e quitament un <b>sotamans</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"sotamans\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. Sa <b>cartabèla d’escòla</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"cartabèla d'escòla\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> es per tèrra darrièr el.","t01-14-5":"Las doas taulas del fons de la classa son ocupadas per de <b>bons escolans</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bons escolans\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Dessenh e musica.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — Dins la <b>sala de dessenh</b> i a de polits <b>modèls</b> pendolats a la paret e una <b>lampa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> amb <b>abatjorn</b>, pendolada al plafon. Lo <b>professor</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"professor\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> es fòrça pacient; corregís los <b>dessenhs</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"dessenhs\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> dels escolans e lor ensenha de dessenhar un <b>bust</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"bust\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> d’après natura.","t01-16-1":"16. — La <b>sala de musica</b> sembla fòrça interessanta. Aquí s’apren de legir la <b>musica</b>, de solfejar las <b>nòtas de la gama</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"nòtas de la gama\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> escrichas sus la <b>portada</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), de reconéisser las <b>claus</b> e de cantar de polidas <b>melodias</b>. Se pausan las particions sul <b>pupitre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pupitre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. Un dels escolans <b>jòga del pianò</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"jòga del pianò\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> e lo <b>professor de musica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"professor de musica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>bat la mesura</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"bat la mesura\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Començam de veire un canton de l’<b>obrador</b> de <b>trabalhs manuals</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"trabalhs manuals\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>, ont los dròlles pòdon aprene de rabotar la fusta e de limar lo fèrre. N’i a pas dins totes los instituts.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">La sala de sciéncias.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — Lo professor de matematicas ensenha als escolans la <b>geometria, l’aritmetica, lo calcul</b> e lo <b>sistèma metric</b>. Vesèm sus la taula las principalas figuras de geometria: un <b>cercle</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"cercle\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, un <b>carrat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"carrat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, un <b>triangle</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangle\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, una <b>linha</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"linha\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Vesèm tanben una <b>operacion</b>; es pas una <b>adicion</b>, ni una <b>sostraccion</b>, ni una <b>multiplicacion</b>: es una <b>division</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"division\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — Sus la lamina del sistèma metric destriam: un <b>mètre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"mètre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, una <b>balança</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balança\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> e sos <b>pes</b>, un <b>litre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"litre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, un <b>decalitre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"decalitre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, un <b>decilitre</b> e un <b>mètre cubic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"mètre cubic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Los escolans estúdian tanben las <b>sciéncias naturalas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"laminas muralas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button> — zoologia <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, botanica <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botanica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, geologia <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> — e l’<b>istòria</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"laminas muralas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"Dins l’armari i a los instruments de <b>fisica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"fisica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> e de <b>quimia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"quimia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"Dessús l’armari i a: una <b>esfèra</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"esfèra\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, un <b>còne</b> e un <b>globe terrèstre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"globe terrèstre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Dessús las laminas pendola una <b>mapa</b> que representa las cinc parts del mond: l’<b>Euròpa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Euròpa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, l’<b>Asia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Asia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, l’<b>Africa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Africa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, l’<b>America</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"America\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"America\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> e l’<b>Oceania</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceania\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, e los dos grands oceans, lo <b>Pacific</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pacific\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> e l’<b>Atlantic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) Pels <i>noms de batisme</i> se conselha de los transcriure tanben dins sa forma latina. Es l’unic mejan d’evitar de variantas sens nombre. D’alhors, cossí causir entre <i>Giovanni, Jean,</i> <i>Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan,</i> etc.? Caldrà crear un diccionari especial dels noms de batisme? Prenguem del latin son nominatiu e disèm: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Gramatica completa)."}}
